      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaku mpùŋa kukanwa keyi! Hakwinza nakukwatana kwitala daYehova neyi mbuulu, muloŋa amotoka dehi chitiyaŋenu chami, aputola dehi nshimbi jami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akadilila kudami nawu, Eyi Nzambi yami, etu aIsarela twakwiluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AIsarela ananati dehi yuma yayiwahi; akamuhaya kudi chilumbu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aswanisha dehi anyanta, ilaŋa hichakudamuku; ashamu dehi atulamba, ilaŋa ami kuchiluka nehi. Kusiliva yawu nikuwuru wawu anonaku dehi yakwila nachu mukishi, kulonda adiŋiyishi nachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Samariya, yena naleki kaneyi kaŋombi; kuzuwa kwami kunayibutukili; mwakanyi wamba kabulawu chuma chakuyinkela nyiloŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu chuma chinafumi kudi aIsarela; akatuŋili kudi nkoŋi, chumochu hiNzambuku; mwalala oku kana kaŋombi kakuSamariya akakotola kotu kotu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa wena adi nakukuwa mpepela akaaŋula chinjimbi. Hakweti tidiku yemanaku; mapolela hiyakasoŋa wuŋaku; hela neyi akasoŋa, akawuminya kudi antu akwacheŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AIsarela ayiminya dehi; ichi dinu hiyadi mukachi kanyuza neyi nswaha yaseka dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anakanduki kuAshuri, neyi chimbulu wamwisaŋa wudi nakudikimbukila kanka windi. Efweremi nondi dehi ambanda akwakumukeŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwalala anafweteli ankwashi mukachi kanyuza, ilaŋa ami nukuyikuŋula katataka; mpinji yantesha akaleka kuwayisha mwanta nawatulamba manji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanavulishiyi Efweremi tumeŋa kulonda avulumuni, tumeŋa kudi yena twela dehi twakuvulumuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela nukumusonekela nshimbi jami yijila ikombakaji, wena akayifuukula neyi chuma chakwacheŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila yimuna yanyilambu yami yaketulaŋawu, alambulaŋa mbiji nikuyidya ayidyaloŋa; ilaŋa Yehova hayitiyaloŋa kuwaha kwinduku. Ichi dinu wukwanuka kuluwa kwawu, wukuyibabesha nanshidi jawu; akafunta cheŋi kuEjipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu Isarela navulameni dehi Wanamutuŋili, hakutuŋatuŋa yipaŋu; niYuda nawa navulishi dehi nyikala yakuhata mumpwembu; ilaŋa ami nakatemesha kesi hanyikala yindi, kakalasha yipaŋu yidumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
